O76/03: Pantheon+ 1701 SNe — IDCM vs ΛCDM Hubble diagram
======================================================================

載入 1701 個 SNe (z range: 0.0012 - 2.261)
Covariance: (1701, 1701)
z > 2: 1, z > 1: 25, z < 0.1: 741

--- 4. IDCM fit M ---
M_IDCM = -19.3151
χ²_IDCM = 2096.0 / 1701 dof
χ²/dof = 1.233

--- 5. ΛCDM fit M + Ωm (H0=ω_ring 固定) ---
Ωm = 0.3810, M_ΛCDM = -19.2451
χ²_ΛCDM = 1989.3 / 1701 dof
χ²/dof = 1.171

--- 6. 比較 ---
模型           參數       χ²         χ²/dof    
────────────────────────────────────────────
IDCM         0 (M)    2096.0     1.233     
ΛCDM         2 (M,Ωm) 1989.3     1.171     

Δχ² = +106.7 (IDCM - ΛCDM)
ΔAIC = +104.7 (負 = IDCM 好)
→ ΛCDM fit 得更好

